356	     * {@link #customerCode} (the segment before the first {@code '-'}). Because the customer code is
357	     * assigned as {@code <REGION>-<HASH8>} with REGION taken from the postcode, the locality follows
358	     * the same region-and-hash identity as the customer code. {@code UNKNOWN} when the owner has no
359	     * customer code.
360	     */
