371	     * locality}/region via the fixed region-to-timezone table ({@code NSW -> Australia/Sydney},
372	     * {@code VIC -> Australia/Melbourne}, {@code QLD -> Australia/Brisbane}), or {@code null}
373	     * when the region is not in the table. Not persisted.
